meta {
  name: Liveness (healthz)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/healthz
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  The probe run-live-lanes.sh waits on before any seeding. No auth. Fleet
  serves HTTPS with a per-run self-signed cert (SAN: sg-fleet, localhost,
  127.0.0.1) minted into $HOME/.sg-fleet-lab.XXXXXX - trust that fleet.crt or
  Bruno will refuse the connection; verification is never disabled in this lab.
}
